Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.94,0:00:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.11,0:00:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}抱歉迟到了  没错过什么吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Sorry I'm late. Did I miss anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.11,0:00:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔伊在嘴里放了15块奥立奥饼干{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Joey stuffing fifteen Oreos in his mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}15片{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Fifteen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}刷新个人纪录哦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Your personal best! Ha, ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.25,0:00:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你到哪儿去了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}赴了个约会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}On a date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我去逛城郊的博物馆  在火车上认识了一个女孩{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I met this girl on a train going to a museum upstate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哪间博物馆  你是怎么认识她的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, Which museum? Oh, yeah! How'd you meet her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不用理我  回答他的问题{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No. Answer his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  火车后厢就我们两个人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, it was just me and her at the back of the train,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的座位靠门  她要换车的话{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}and I sat near the door so she'd have to pass by me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.93,0:00:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}就得从我边上过  她拿我没办法{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...if she wanted to switch cars. She was totally at my mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你迟到是因为和她神侃吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Were you so late because you were burring this woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.82,0:00:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不是  我赶紧回来了  因为她住在Poughkeepsie（纽约州东南部）{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, I'm getting back down 'cause she lives in Poughkeepsie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她看上去真的很不错  住在2个半小时的路程之外{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She seems really great, but she lives two and a half hours away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.03,0:00:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}都住在Poughkeepsie了  怎么还会很棒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How can she be great if she's from Poughkeepsie? Ha-ha-ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}到Albany（纽约州首府）就没笑话可讲了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That joke would have killed in Albany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:00:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好了  我吃下去了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Done! I did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.71,0:01:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}现在谁才傻啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Heh, Who's stupid now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}老友记  第四季  第10集  乱点鸳鸯谱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Friends S04E10  The one with the girl from Poughkeepsie{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：詹妮弗·安妮斯顿）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：柯特妮·考克斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.40,0:01:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：丽莎·库卓）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.82,0:01:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：马特·勒布朗）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：马修·派瑞）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：大卫·修蒙）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  看这个  今晚他们要点亮这棵大圣诞树{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, look at this! They're lighting the big Christmas tree tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.89,0:01:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那是两周前的报纸{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, that paper is two weeks old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是谁老是把旧报纸  丢在垃圾桶里的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right, Who keeps leaving old newspapers in the trash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我本来想带凯西去看  没想到居然错过了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I really wanted to take Kathy to this. I can't believe I missed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  你至少还有人可以和你一起“错过”机会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, y'know, at least you have somebody to miss that stuff with!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.70,0:02:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我已经孤独整整一年了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I hate being alone this time of year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.99,0:02:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}接着我又要一个人过情人节{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Next thing it'll be Valentine's Day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的生日  然后又是"嗙"{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...then my birthday, then bang!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在你反应过来之前  又是圣诞节了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}before you know it, they're lighting that damn tree again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}噢  我想有人陪{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ohh, I want somebody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要个真正的"男人"{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, I want a man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我是说  哪怕不是正式的交往  而只是"逢场作戏"一次也好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, it doesn't even have to be a big relationship. y'know, just like a fling would be great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真的  我还以为女孩子从来不想搞"一夜情"的呢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Really?! I didn’t think girls ever just wanted a fling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我告诉你  我很早以前就来过"一夜情"了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Let me tell you, it's been a long time since I've been flung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}噢  那我知道圣诞节要送你什么了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, I know what I'm giving you for Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我有几个同事挺不错的  要不要帮你介绍一下{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}There are nice guys in my office. Want me to set you up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:02:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好啊  等等  我已经单身好久了  你以前为什么不提{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah! Wait a minute, it's been a long time that I've been single. How come you never offered this before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我现在有女朋友了  很快乐{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, I have a girlfriend, I'm-I'm happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以  我不再需要把快乐建筑在他人的痛苦之上了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So, I no longer feel the need to go out of my way to stop others from being happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.63,0:03:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不要会计师{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No accountants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.05,0:03:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}也不要律师  我不喜欢工作无聊的男人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And no one from "legal." I don't like boring jobs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}噢  罗斯工作不无聊吗  他是驯兽师么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh and Ross was like what? A lion tamer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}怎么回事  莫妮{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What's wrong, Mon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}餐馆的所有人都恨我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ohh, everybody at the restaurant still hates me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}本来我想我的人缘好起来了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I thought I was making headway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}大家都冲着我微笑  下班后{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Everyone was smiling at me all day, and then I get off work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}才发现他们在我帽子上写了这个{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}and find out that they wrote this on my chef's hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（婊子  快辞职）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}也许他们想写的是 "婊子  快住嘴"{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, maybe they meant to write, "Quiet, Bitch."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿  亲爱的  怎么了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, honey! What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}干嘛  火气这么大{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Fine! Just trying to be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}从幼儿园后  我就没被这么捉弄过了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I haven't been picked on this much since kindergarten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}当时他们找了个国中生 来监视我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And they brought in someone from junior high to do the see-saw with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们想尽办法赶我走{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean they're trying to do everything they can to make me quit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}换做是别的工作  我早就不干了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}and if there were any other job, I would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但是这是我一生都想从事的职业{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This is something I've been waiting for my whole life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哦  等等  你是老大{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, wait a minute, you're the boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么不吼他们  或干脆炒了他们{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why don't you just yell at them? Or, fire them?{\r}
